cabe4790-5858-4bf4-9792-79aa4d6fa347	TOH KWAN RZEN	Live Potrait Painting	Visual Arts	\n    Hi there! I am an Toh Kwan Rzen, an 18 -year-old busker specialized in portrait sketching.\n\nIn my act, you see me play no instrument, hear me sing with no voice, except, dedicating a short session in which we sit face to face as i patiently breathe a sketch of you to life on paper, all done so unconditionally.\n\nDo come down and visit me, and  even just your very presence is an immense contribution, not just to an emerging individual like me, but the whole of Singapore's Arts scene!\n\n	""	\N	2024-09-10 06:55:09.219+00	\N	\N
