8c87882a-49af-4f01-b64e-3aa660fdd8b4	SOO SHENG LI	GUITAR & SINGING	Music	\n    A guitarist and singer based in Singapore, Sheng Li fell in love with performing while busking, fascinated by the wonderfully spontaneous experiences sharing music with people on the streets.\n\nIn 2023, after busking for 7 years, he took part in UFM100.3’s inaugural busking competition《街头霸王》and clinched the title of “Busk King”.\n\nSheng Li has also been featured in TODAY and NUYOU, where he shared about his journey as a busker and pursuing music part-time.\n\nBesides playing regularly for weddings and events, he enjoys collaborating with other musicians and inspiring people to discover the joy of learning music through his YouTube channel and online guitar course.\n\nWant to catch his next performance? Follow him on Instagram @guitarstreet for his latest busking schedule!\n\n	"https://facebook.com/guitarstreet.sg, https://instagram.com/guitarstreet, https://youtube.com/guitarstreetmusic, https://www.guitarstreet.sg/"	\N	2024-09-07 20:19:50.898+00	\N	\N
