caa6bf4c-f464-4a96-ad7e-847e6400c371	Sonorous 颂之乐	GUITAR & SINGING	Music	\n    我们颂之乐二人组合年龄已超过150岁，演出包括经典歌，有华语，闽南语和日语多种曲风。喜欢听老歌的忠实粉丝，一定充满期待去观赏吧 ! 歌手会展现这些老歌的韵味，吉打手也会弹出他的高超技巧。年轻人如果想感受那个时代流行的曲风，就请期待您的光临吧！\n\nTheir performance will feature a variety of classic old songs, encompassing multiple styles including Mandarin, Hokkien, and Japanese. The combined age of the two artists exceeds 150 years, and they are incredibly talented! Especially for those iconic songs, if you want to experience the musical style of that era and witness a high-level performance, come and see the show of these two artists!\n\n	""	\N	2024-11-07 19:24:42.083+00	\N	\N
