2acc5988-4cf4-4aaa-b1b2-cf8a5dceb29d	REYHAN MISHRA	GUITAR & SINGING	Music	\n    Hi there, I’m Reyhan! An 8th grade student at the Singapore American School. I’m 13 years old, and playing the guitar and singing have been my favorite passions since I was little. Thanks for listening, and don’t forget to drop a follow to my Instagram, @reyhanrocks!\n\n	""	\N	2024-10-05 10:18:45.093+00	\N	\N
c5144408-0320-4c57-bc8c-5e7e7cf2e8a0	LYLA NG ZI NING	GUITAR, KEYBOARD & SINGING	Music	\n    Hailing from the sunny island of Singapore, Lyla Ng, 黄姿宁, is an up and coming musician, songwriter and multi-instrumentalist with a burning passion for all things music. The cheery wide-eyed 9 year old practises music on a daily basis. Inspired by internationally acclaimed artists like BLACKPINK, Foo Fighters, Billie Eilish and Beabadoobee, her inspirations are extremely diverse to say the least.\n\nEven at a tender age of 9, Lyla's drive to becoming a first-rate musician surmounts many others that are far older and experienced. Constantly releasing new videos to share about her music and skateboarding journey on multiple social media platforms, the young skater girl muso has already garnered a total of over 5 million combined views on her social media platforms.\nWith big dreams and plenty of energy to spare, Lyla Ng, 黄姿宁 seeks to bring joy and laughter to people through music, and is well on her way to becoming one of the most influential music makers in her generation.\n\n	"https://www.facebook.com/lylahzn, https://www.instagram.com/lylahzn/"	\N	2024-10-24 11:52:13.937+00	\N	\N
