a8659502-317e-4a72-a234-41d070942923	MICHELLE CHUA	GUZHENG	Music	\n    Michelle Chua, a local guzheng Musician born and raised in Singapore, dedicated three \ndecades of passion in mastering this enchanting ancient Chinese art form. She has coached \nnumerous guzheng ensembles in both primary and secondary schools, attaining gold \nmedals at the SYF Arts Presentations.  Trained under renowned local guzheng virtuoso master Mr. Tan Chin Huat, her commanding technique and emotive performance style captivate audiences, from bustling \ncity streets to major festivals. Together with Mr. Tan, they founded “Zheng Professionals” \nin 2004 to promote the art form and nurture local instructors nurture the next generation of \nguzheng masters. As an acclaimed performer, active busker and charity performer, Michelle hopes to share \nthe beauty of this traditional Chinese instrument across the community, inspiring the next \ngeneration to embrace this timeless musical legacy. She hopes her commitment in \npreserving this cultural heritage. Contact : 81130828\n\n	"https://m.facebook.com/ZhengProfessionals/, https://www.instagram.com/skymichelle/, https://m.youtube.com/channel/UCFz7b9E2TX2bOmiGctQJkyA"	\N	2024-09-09 11:18:12.504+00	\N	\N
