24f684b1-f5cf-40b2-85c7-9006722fafdc	CAROLINE JANE CORNELIUS-JONES	SOAP BUBBLE PERFORMANCE	Theatre	\n    Hi, I'm Caroline aka CJ the Bubble Girl. I'm a full time soap bubble artist & performer.\nI've been performing with my bubbles in Singapore since 2009. \n\nI create 3D sculptures from the simple soap bubble. Plus I love using implements found around the home to create whimsical bubble effects. \n\nBubbles bring us back to our childhood, to those magical, joy fill days. Let me transport you back and create new joy filled memories for you.\n\nI have 2x Guinness participation World Records and 2x bubble entries in the Singapore Book of Records.\n\n	"https://www.facebook.com/cjthebubblegirl/, https://www.instagram.com/cjthebubblegirl/, https://youtube.com/c/CJtheBubbleGirl, https://www.cjbubbles.com/"	\N	2024-10-29 06:24:44.77+00	\N	\N
