259a7fe3-8b5d-4977-9521-e48078e5f279	GBJJ (Ge bi jiejie) Sisters Next Door	GUITAR & SINGING	Music	\n    We are GBJJ! Also known as 隔壁姐姐 or Sisters next door! \nWe are your friendly neighbours who love music and wish to share the joy and cheer it brings to us with you too! \n\nCatch us on the streets and join us as we sway and dance to some of your favourite mando and cantopop tunes.\n\n	""	\N	2024-09-09 11:18:12.229+00	\N	\N
2c6b9107-39fc-491c-882a-04746d9d69f1	KOH BERNARD	GUITAR & SINGING	Music	\n    From singing with teenage friends in HDB void decks to the surprise of making it as a finalist in the 1978 RTS* Talentime, music has always been a major part of my life. Now, with the freedom of retirement, busking allows me to socially interact, publicly perform, keep physically active, and stay mentally young.\n*Radio and Television Singapore\n \n \n\n	""	\N	2024-09-09 11:18:12.886+00	\N	\N
dceb2503-b16d-4c99-ae8c-3d064d91ccb9	CLIFF LEE JUN WEI	GUITAR & SINGING	Music	\n    Cliff Lee aka “OFFTHECLIFF” is a full-time independent Singer-Songwriter, Busker, Music Coach, Events Performer, and Music Producer. He is a believer in all things dreams-related and a motivator for all to jump for theirs. \n\nExperience \n• ~10 years of busking on the streets\n• 200+ gigs (Weddings, Parties, Hotels, Pubs, Corporate Functions, Anniversaries, Festivals, Livestream Events...)\n• 20+ years of performing locally and internationally \n• Performs a variety of genres (English, Mandarin, Modern, Oldies, Pop, Rock, Alternative, Country, Christian...) \n• Taught 2000+ students (Guitar, Ukulele, Drums, Cajon, Singing) \n• 2000+ CDs and Digital copies sold (Original Songs)\n\n☎️ SMS or Whatsapp 9631 0740 to engage OFFTHECLIFF \n\n	"https://www.facebook.com/offthecliff.music, https://www.Instagram.com/offthecliff.music, https://www.YouTube.com/offthecliff, https://ogc.link/u/OFFTHECLIFF"	\N	2024-09-09 11:18:13.904+00	\N	\N
