8b034079-7b40-4177-a633-d87cc7ada600	KHAN ZHI YING	KEYBOARD	Music	\n    I am a musician and artist! I play the keyboard, piano and electone-stagea. I like to paint landscapes and abstract art pieces. My favourite animal is the domestic cat.\n\nFor my music, it mainly comprises English and Chinese oldies like those of the Elvis Presley and Engelbert Humperdinck era, and Teresa Teng and Cai Qin era.\n\nI also know a handful of music from different countries and languages like Anak, Benci Tapi Rindu, Rasa Sayang, Lenggang Kangkong, Madu Dan Racun, Subaru, Sukiyaki, Arirang etc.\n\nMy favourite musicians are Yiruma and Richard Clayderman. I can also play songs by them. My favourite classical piano piece is Nocturne in E-flat Major by Frederic Chopin.\n\nIf you would like to engage me to perform at your event, please email me at jiangzhiying33@gmail.com or contact me at 9752-7060.\n\nThank you very much.\n\n	""	\N	2024-09-08 15:50:12.83+00	\N	\N
