bc639b75-2b70-484e-9aab-758647320b5a	Harris Bin Osman	GUITAR & SINGING	Music	\n    Harris Osman is a young and thriving artist who sings to touch the hearts of others with his authenticity and passion for music. Having grown up in a family of musicians, Harris began experimenting with music since the tender age of 8, drawing inspiration from his father’s tunes of rock and roll. His love for music only grew from then.\n\nIt wasn’t long before Harris took his dreams to the stage — performing in his school for celebrations became a yearly tradition. Soon after, the self-taught artist took his dreams to the streets as well — he began busking and sharing his soulful vocals and emotional pieces with the public.\n\nDespite the milestones achieved, Harris wished to further pursue his love for the craft. He strives not only to earn from music, but also to give back to music. \n\n	"https://www.instagram.com/hxrrs/"	\N	2024-09-09 11:18:15.961+00	\N	\N
