093e4d7d-0561-442e-824a-c187b8a01c12	LIM YAN WEI DARREN	GUITAR, KEYBOARD & SINGING	Music	\n    Influenced by the melodies of Mandopop, the production elements of K-Pop, and the aesthetic visions of Western pop, Darren Ryder Lim is a pop singer-songwriter and producer who hopes to share his stories through music.\n\n Since he was 18, he has honed his songwriting and music production skills, using them to cope with the struggles of growing up as an awkward young person. Like his influences, he channels his innermost thoughts into his songs, especially during his lowest moments. By incorporating elements from various genres, he aims to reveal different sides of himself and take his music to the next level.\n\nUltimately, Darren is just a regular 20-something with dreams of becoming a musician. Through his music, he hopes to give a voice to those who feel disillusioned by the troubles of growing up. With that, he hopes to invite his listeners to join him as he begins his musical journey.\n\n	""	\N	2024-09-09 11:18:16.269+00	{"contact_info": "https://t.me/Xuanzzz", "contact_method": "Telegram", "accept_swap_requests": true}	\N
