d2c0110c-cf3a-4875-8995-cf5b0163a595	MOHAMMAD SAID BIN RAHIM	GUITAR & SINGING	Music	\n    Mr Mohammad Said Rahim has been busking since 2014. He doesn't entertain crowds for a living though. Mr Said is also an English Literature teacher.  "Busking allows me the freedom to express myself and share my talent with the community. I'm very happy to contribute positively to the mood and lives of others."\nMr Said enjoys playing contemporary and evergreen top-40 ballads and easy-listening tunes. He hopes to pursue busking for as long as he can and believes that it would be a rewarding activity to pursue especially in his golden years. But for now, he is happy to do both teaching and busking in his free time.\n\n	"https://www.facebook.com/buskrsaid, https://www.instagram.com/buskrsaid, https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG0Z-WWbuftrEy4RWkLdvxQ"	\N	2024-09-09 11:18:13.939+00	\N	\N
