81e4db7c-66eb-457a-a107-fec11fe7604c	LIM TECK YI	CHINESE INSTRUMENT - GUZHENG	Music	\n    Teck Yi is a home-grown Singaporean talent, who has been performing guzheng since he was a child. Besides playing traditional guzheng classics, Teck Yi enjoys exploring modern genres on the guzheng, such as pop, film and songs of different cultures, and sharing his cover arrangements on Instagram. Under his IG handle @onstyrings (formed from the acronym of his name "TY" and him playing "on strings"), he posts about his musical activities, from busking to events.\n\n	"https://www.instagram.com/onstyrings/, https://www.youtube.com/@onstyrings"	4abbef23-bfc4-4f78-b9ad-0fe0b3875fb4	2024-09-09 11:18:13.716+00	{"contact_info": "", "contact_method": "", "accept_swap_requests": false}	{"custom_bio": null}
